*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0040
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : A.W.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-04-19 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-12-06 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 923
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0040.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    05 ACCOUNT-TYPE       PIC X.
    *> AVERAGE MONTHLY BALANCE
    05 AVG-MTH-BAL        PIC 9(7)V99.
    05 PROC-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 PROC-DATE-R REDEFINES PROC-DATE.
       10 PROC-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 PROC-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 PROC-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(6).
01 OUT-RECORD.
    *> FEE WAIVER INDICATOR
    05 WAIVE-IND          PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    *> MONTHLY SERVICE FEE
    05 SVC-CHARGE         PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM MONTHLY-FEE-CHECK
    DISPLAY "WAIVE-IND=" WAIVE-IND
    DISPLAY "SVC-CHARGE=" SVC-CHARGE
    STOP RUN.
MONTHLY-FEE-CHECK.
    *> MONTHLY FEE WAIVER
    IF ACCOUNT-TYPE = 'G'
       OR ACCOUNT-TYPE = 'P'
       OR AVG-MTH-BAL >= 5000
        MOVE 'Y' TO WAIVE-IND
        MOVE 0 TO SVC-CHARGE
    ELSE
        MOVE 5 TO SVC-CHARGE
    END-IF.
